{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /private/tmp/sc-pushy-a1/.claude/skills/meeting-actions\n\n# Meeting actions\n\nTurn meeting notes into a list of action items.\n\n## Format\n\nWrite `actions.md` with one action per line, in this shape:\n\n```\n- <owner> — <what> — by <when>\n```\n\nOwner is a first name. When is a weekday plus a date, or \"ongoing\".\nSkip anything that isn't a decision or a commitment.\n\n## Done\n\nEvery action has an owner, a what, and a when. No prose, no headings.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: notes.txt"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad6412eb-8f60-4501-ab6b-8bc775087d91","uuid":"f835a708-d288-486e-96f7-c59e03a1e44d","timestamp":"2026-09-10T12:47:24.103Z","isSynthetic":true}
